      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"group\" id=\"q10-11-12-13-anchor\"><h4>Questions 10-13</h4><p>Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?</p><div class=\"question-item\"><p><strong>10</strong> The first dance academy opened in Italy during the 15th century.</p><div class=\"radio-options\"><label><input name=\"q10\" type=\"radio\" value=\"TRUE\"> TRUE</label><label><input name=\"q10\" type=\"radio\" value=\"FALSE\"> FALSE</label><label><input name=\"q10\" type=\"radio\" value=\"NOT GIVEN\"> NOT GIVEN</label></div></div><div class=\"question-item\"><p><strong>11</strong> Jean Georges Noverre believed that ballet should be part of opera.</p><div class=\"radio-options\"><label><input name=\"q11\" type=\"radio\" value=\"TRUE\"> TRUE</label><label><input name=\"q11\" type=\"radio\" value=\"FALSE\"> FALSE</label><label><input name=\"q11\" type=\"radio\" value=\"NOT GIVEN\"> NOT GIVEN</label></div></div><div class=\"question-item\"><p><strong>12</strong> Tchaikovsky composed music for several famous Russian ballets.</p><div class=\"radio-options\"><label><input name=\"q12\" type=\"radio\" value=\"TRUE\"> TRUE</label><label><input name=\"q12\" type=\"radio\" value=\"FALSE\"> FALSE</label><label><input name=\"q12\" type=\"radio\" value=\"NOT GIVEN\"> NOT GIVEN</label></div></div><div class=\"question-item\"><p><strong>13</strong> George Balanchine's neoclassical ballets focused on elaborate storytelling.</p><div class=\"radio-options\"><label><input name=\"q13\" type=\"radio\" value=\"TRUE\"> TRUE</label><label><input name=\"q13\" type=\"radio\" value=\"FALSE\"> FALSE</label><label><input name=\"q13\" type=\"radio\" value=\"NOT GIVEN\"> NOT GIVEN</label></div></div></div>",
